### Kullanıcı Kayıt Başarılı
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Emre",
  "surname": "Girgin",
  "email": "mazlumemregirgin@msn.com",
  "phone": "55511256",
  "password": "133316",
  "role": "FARMER"
}


###

### Email Boş Gönderilirse (Validation Error)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ayşe",
  "surname": "Demir",
  "phone": "050099988747",
  "email": "",
  "password": "short",
  "role": "BUYER"
}

###

### Fazladan Key Gönderilirse (JacksonConfig FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mehmet",
  "surname": "Kara",
  "phone": "05007776655",
  "email": "mehmet@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword",
  "role": "TRUCKER",
  "extraField": "bunu backend kabul etmez"
}

###

### Geçersiz Role Gönderilirse (IllegalArgumentException)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali",
  "surname": "Vural",
  "phone": "05005554433",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "strongpassword",
  "role": "INVALID_ROLE"
}

###

