### Verify Email Code (Doğru Kod)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/verification/verifyCode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mazlumemregirgin@msn.com",
  "verificationCode": "366938"
}

###

### Verify Email Code (Yanlış Kod)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/verification/verifyCode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mazlumemregirgin@msn.com",
  "verificationCode": "882633"
}

###

### Verify Email Code (Expire Olmuş Kod)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/verification/verifyCode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mazlumemregirgin@msn.com",
  "verificationCode": "654321"
}


### Resend Verification Code
POST http://localhost:8080/api/verification/resendCode?email=mazlumemregirgin@msn.com


